window.products.push({"id":432068,"name":"THREAD SPREAD Viscose from Bamboo Bed Pillowcases, 2Pc Pillowcase Pair for King Size Pillows, with Extra Long Staple Cases, Soft & Cooling Luxury Case","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n5fsnS0pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEY HIGHLIGHTS: ● 300 Thread Count - 100% Viscose Bamboo Pillowcase Set ● Silky and smooth as silk, cool as cotton ● Extremely breathable and moisture-wicking ● Eco-friendly & a better choice for the planet ● Vegan, cruelty-free, and botanic origin ● Machine washable - stain, fade, and odor resistant OUR BAMBOO PILLOWCASES KING SIZE CONTAINS: 2 King-sized pillow covers measuring 21” W x 40” L. WHY YOU’D LOVE OUR BAMBOO BED PILLOW CASES? ● REAL, GENUINE QUALITY: Bamboo products from other brands are blended with polyester and linen. Our Verve bamboo pillow cases king size 2 pack is derived from 100% viscose from the bamboo plant – which means no blending. ● NATURALLY COOL & BREATHABLE IN DRY, HUMID SEASONS: Bamboo king size pillow cases are naturally cooler and more breathable than cotton for a better sleeping experience. It’s great for hot sleepers who sweat a lot in summer. ● GREAT FOR YOUR SKIN & HAIR: Sateen weave reduces friction between surfaces, keeping your hair frizz-free and skin radiant. ● MORE DURABLE & STRONGER THAN OTHER FABRICS: Bamboo king pillowcases hold dye well, which means they don’t fade or pill easily, making them more durable than other fabrics. IS BAMBOO REALLY A BETTER ALTERNATIVE? Yes! Bamboo king size pillow cases are sustainable and eco-friendly because they don’t require much water or chemicals to grow. At Thread Spread, we are committed to green sourcing and processes. Our signature king pillow case bamboo uses 500x less water and produces 52% less CO2 than cotton. DOES IT PROMOTE HEALTHY SKIN & HAIR? Yes. Bamboo has satin anti-ageing properties that keep your skin young and radiant. The sateen fabric keeps your hair frizz-free and hydrated, prevents hair breakage and split ends, and promotes a healthier scalp. HOW EASY IS IT TO WASH BAMBOO PILLOWCASES? Very easy. Machine wash in cold water with a mild liquid detergent. Line dry or tumble dry on low mode after the wash. Our bamboo pillowcase king don’t fade or pill on the wash.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n5fsnS0pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B0BD58H676","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD58H676","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD58H676","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
