window.products.push({"id":432126,"name":"LMIKAF Office Chair, High Back Adjustable Ergonomic Desk Chair, Executive PU Leather Swivel Task Chair with Lumbar Support and Footrest, Smooth&Silent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710+IWfGFeS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【660Lbs Big Tall Office Chair】 - LMIKAF office chair can support 660lbs(300kg) weight capacity for long-lasting use. It has a larger seat and backrest with an extra pillow. The office chair has a heavy-duty, extra-reinforced gas bar and base that support heavier loads over longer periods. ✅【High End Material】 - The executive chair is upholstered carefully-selected PU material that is waterproof and resistant stains, easy to wipe clean,and filled with high-density sponge padding for a natural leather look for an upscale look,unique looks makes the computer chair perfect addition to any office. ✅【Ergonomic Comfort Reclining Desk Chair】 - Sitting in a ergonomic desk chair, it will train your body to sit with a healthy posture. That takes the pressure off of the back and neck. It also makes your core muscles stronger. Over time, the simple act of using a office chair will yield many benefits. These include deeper breathing, better blood flow, looser limbs, and increased vitality. ✅【Office Chair Standard Dimensions】- Overall height(top to the floor): 47.24-51.18\"(120-130cm). Adjustable height: 4\"(10cm). Chair seat depth: 23.62\"(60cm). Chair seat width(included armrests): 24.21\"(61.5cm). Armrests height: 10.63\" (27cm). ✅【Adjustable Parts】- Find your optimal position by raising or lowering your chair, reclining between 90 - 150 degrees with multifunction tilt-lock to adjust and infinite locking positions. Soft, padded armrests pivot with the chair as it reclines. Full 360 degrees of swivel rotation enable dynamic movement. ✅【Applicable Places】- This office chair is suitable for the office, gaming room, living room, bedroom, the study and so on. It will make your space more modern and elegant. ✅【Our service】- If you meet any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will reply you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710+IWfGFeS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LMIKAF","source_asin":"B08KD2XF6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KD2XF6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KD2XF6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
