window.products.push({"id":432144,"name":"Medelon Rapid Electric Egg Cooker with Automatic Shut Off,Egg Boiler,Egg Poacher,Egg Steamer Stainless Steel Tray 7 Eggs Capacity for Soft or Hard Boi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AxV3j5+3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Direction of Use 1. Put some water on the plate of the boiler base . and then place the eggs holder 2. Stand the eggs on the egg holder and cover the upper lid at last (the amount of water will determine the egg tenderness) 3. Connect the plug into power, press the indicator button, the indicator will light, what means the egg boiler star working 4. When water run out , egg boiler will automatic cut off ,egg have been well cooked Tips: *If our eggs just take out from the refrigerator with low temperature,It will better to add more water about 5-8ML ,and it will better cooked. *After the boiler cut off , it will be better to wait 1-2 minutes to open the upper lid. Cleaning and Maintenance 1. Switch of the plug after use 2. Do not use the hard brash to water the boiling plate and upper the lid to avoid any scratches 3. Do not place the appliance or part into water . can not clean by watering directly should clean the outside of base by moist cloth 4. long time no use the appliance should clean and well pack Our Service Medelon get 100% NO RISK MONEY BACK GUARANTEE.if there are any quality problem, please contact us.send your order number and take some photos of the product to us, we will provide a replacement to you ASAP.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AxV3j5+3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"medelon","source_asin":"B07DB26XKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DB26XKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DB26XKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
