window.products.push({"id":432259,"name":"CHICVIE Canvas Comforters Bags Closet Organizers and Storage for Quilts Clothes Organization Containers Bins with Sturdy Zipper, Clear Window 75L for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61orgdwAjqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3pck Closet organization Odorless Material containers for organizing 90% Pure Cotton +10% Polyester-wool, tidy storage containers zippered storage bags . Clothes Organizer : The best organization and storage solutions give you a relaxed mood and a relief feeling. The organizing environment gives you a good rest physically and mentally. Once you touch the surface of our Storage bins, you will love it as we love you to love your life. Let our storage organizer be a part of your contribution to your organization and storage plan. Closet Storage ：CHICVIE's clearance items for home proudly provide you with a first-class quality bin for closet organization for your daily life. Pure natural cotton and strong canvas beat the cheap non-woven fabric storage box. The Foldable Blanket Storage Bags is single weight up to 17oz to hold up to 40 lbs. Warehouse Clearance Accessories: Super totes for storage Bag: 23×17×12 in (57×43×30 cm) with 3 packs that can meet your different using cases. The Clear window design lets you see clearly what is inside. Convenience solutions for storing and organizing various objects like toys, quilts, clothes, blankets, bath towels, pillows, duvets etc. Breathable material is better than the regular vacuum storage bags Bedding Storage : CHICVIE's bag storage organizer has dozens of processes. Minimalist and Natural Storage Solution: External material, 90% pure cotton / 10% polyester-wool, breathable and odourless, to protect high-value clothes; Internal lamination, waterproof and dustproof, fits your need for bedroom organization and storage. Clothes Storage Bins: Our bedroom accessories bag is a universal space saver. Skin-friendly, ergonomic humanized product design gives this canvas bag reinforced handles on 3 sides, three side openings, easy to pick up and move, two ways 5# zippers, transparent side window for a quit glance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61orgdwAjqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHICVIE","source_asin":"B09XBF9J8B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XBF9J8B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XBF9J8B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":432260,"name":"APRELEE Boho Wall Hanging Shelf with Jute Rope – Set of 2, Paulownia Wood Hanging Shelf for Plants, Wall, Living Room, Nursery & Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EZFdgRQML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features:  Adjustable Height: You can now adjust the height of our golden jute rope hanging shelves by adjusting the Rope. The Ideal vertical height of these shelves is 14.5 inches. Easy to Install: Just follow simple instructions, and you are done assembling these hanging plant shelves. Use two thick jute ropes and create unique patterns to arrange them elegantly on the wall. Make them up in a triangle criss-cross pattern, single swing, parallel swing, or two-tiered - it's completely your choice! Easy to Maintain Balance: Our wall hanging shelves are lightweight but sturdy in nature so that they don’t fall out easily. You can now decorate them with small plants and flowers and cherish the beautiful insight that you created. Wider Applications: Perfect for Storage and Decorations: Bring your room to life by arranging these floating shelves rope onto the wall. Use your extreme creativity to bring happiness to your living. For this, you can use our hanging shelves and place collectables like photo frames, alarm clocks, candles, towels, souvenirs, etc!  Gift for your loved ones: Express your love by giving this admirable gift to your loved ones. This boho shelf is a unique gift and will be surely loved by plant enthusiasts or boho decorations lovers. Decorate your place as you dream it to be. Use them in a kitchen, living room, or washroom, and organize your space neatly using our hanging shelves. Installation Steps: Tie the macrame cord to the ends of wooden shelves and adjust the height according to your need. Hang the shelves by installing hooks to the wall, thus giving a magnificent triangular look to the wall.  Specifications: Material: Paulownia Wood and Jute Rope Small Wall Hanging Shelf  Quantity: Set of 2 Color: Blue Size: L: 15.75” inches, W: 5” inches, H: 0.75” inches Package List: 2 x wood board 2 x jute rope 2 x hooks 4 x wall screws, 4 x drywall anchors","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EZFdgRQML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09JQJ7G23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JQJ7G23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JQJ7G23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
