window.products.push({"id":432313,"name":"AB AttaBoy Led Strip Lights Kit 50ft(15M), Flexible Strip Lights SMD 5050 RGB with Bluetooth App Controller,Tape Lights Kit Sync to Music Rope Lights ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PYWrbP-HL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【50.0ft smart LED Strips & Bluetooth APP Control】Controlling the LED strip lights via \"Lotus Lantern\" APP, remote control and controller. you can freely choose to control 16 million colors. you can adjust the light brightness from 1% to 100% to suit the various places;28 Dynamic Modes can be chosen, like Flashing, Breathing, Strobe, Gradient, etc. Timer function can preset the time to switch lights on/off. 【Three Control Mode】Designed with three control mode: by APP, by Control Box, by Remote Control. Download App-“Lotus Lantern”, simple and fun，create the light atmosphere as you like, just by pressing the button on your smart phone. If you are not used to use the App, Control Box and Remote Control can also do the job quickly, you can chose your favorite one. 【Music Mode】Built-in high sensitivity adjustable microphone, The led strip light is sync to music, The strip light can be changed with sound like music and even your voice which makes the light color change by the music beats or your microphone. Starting the party with music, auto- tuing the light and color, this will make your party time memorable. 【User-friendly& Easy to install】Music Sync LED strip lights have memory function. When the strips are used again, they remember the last mode settings without having to repeat the settings. The flexible strip lights is easy to install, Strong self-adhesive tape, Please ensure to paste it onto any clean, dry and flat surface.you can also use the Buckles provided by us.( Note: Can be cut among every 3 led units to customize the length;Utilize the connectors to connect.) 【Wide Application】LED strip lights total of 50ft,it comes with 2 reel of 25ft LED light strip, an AC Power Adapter, a IR remote Control, a controller,two 4-Pin Connectors, 8 Buckles and a Instruction Manual，Led strip lights are long enough to reach around your entire room and light the whole place up. Perfect to decorate your bedroom, stairs, kitchen, porch, and living room, especially great for Christmas, Halloween Wedding Parties etc. It is also a great gift for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PYWrbP-HL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AB AttaBoy","source_asin":"B0858XF673","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0858XF673","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0858XF673","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
