window.products.push({"id":432564,"name":"willai Cervical Pillow for Neck Pain,Adjustable Neck Support Pillow with Inflatable Tube,Contour Orthopedic Neck Pillows for Sleeping,Best Firm Memory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jX8WaozSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Memory Foam Neck Pillow】 Willai memory foam pillow is designed by a team of professional engineer in conjuction with a number of chiropratic and sleep doctors. Base on analyzing more than 20,000 sleepers from the age, height, weight, material, and habit, we have developed the comfortable neck pillow for many sleepers. 【Unique Support Design】Willai neck support pillow is made of slow rebound memory foam with medium firmness. Built-in inflatable tube technology increases pillow support height. The contour pillow is not only comfortable, but also very supportive, perfect for sleeper between 140 and 250 lbs. NOTE: Sleepers need to inflate every 3 days to maintain the height of cervical support. 【Pain Relief】The cervical neck pillow has an ergonomic design, which can fit your head, neck, and shoulders well. Through the supporting to neck, it can relieve the pressure on the neck and shoulders, thereby release the pain by sleeping comfortably. It's a best neck pillows for pain relief sleeping. WARM REMINDER:Willai cervical pillow can only help us improve sleeping quality, and not be used to diagnose or cure (such as cervical spondylosis). 【Two Sides Support Choice】This pillow has two sides,high side can be inflated to 5.1inches,it's optimal pillow for side sleepers weighted 180lbs above,the low side is 3.5inches,it's good for back sleepers weighted 130lbs above, any sleepers can find the suitable support for sleeping. 【Perfect Gift】Willai orthopedic pillow has strong support, it can effectively reduce insomnia. it's a perfect gift for sleepers with less support sleeping. It's also a good gift for parents,grandpa and grandma. If you have any usage issues with our neck pillow, please contact us, we will reply within 24hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jX8WaozSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"willai","source_asin":"B0C1SHN5W8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1SHN5W8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1SHN5W8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
