window.products.push({"id":432811,"name":"Pavo 2022 Personalized Blanket for Son from Mom - Premium Customized Lion Family Blanket Gift On Birthday, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Mother's Day","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZXj38sUSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ [EXCLUSIVE DESIGNS] Finding thoughtful gifts for your son isn't always easy. That's why we are here to help. There's no gift that speaks \"I love you\" more than a blanket with meaningful messages. This super soft and cozy blanket is a perfect way to tell your son that \"I'll always be with you.\" At Pavo, our highly skilled designers always cater to your needs and strive to turn every gift idea into reality by handling each request with great care ✅ [CUSTOM TAILORED FOR SPECIAL OCCASIONS] Cherish your loved one's celebrations by sharing precious memories with our customized blanket. Pavo's custom fleece blanket will be the perfect present for your parents, spouse, siblings, children, and friends on various occasions like Birthday, Valentine's, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Engagement, Wedding, Anniversary, Thanksgiving, Halloween, Christmas, etc. ✅ [MULTIPLE SIZES - MULTIPLE FUNCTIONS] Pavo's customized blanket comes in various sizes 30\"x40\", 50\"x60\", and 60\"x80\". Hence, our blanket can be used as sofa blanket, bed blanket, bed sheets, tapestry wall hanging, or a great addition to your comforter set. It is also perfect for outdoor activity like camping or go to the beach. Whether you want it in your bedroom for extra warmth, or in the living room for a stylish touch, this throw can keep you comfort in any space. ✅ [EXQUISITE FLEECE FABRIC] Each fleece blanket features a premium polyester print for beautiful color vibrancy, even after washing. This blanket is reversible with one side mimicking soft fur while the other is smooth fleece. The fabric is tested to be long lasting and durable while also keeping you cozy. ✅ [GUARANTEE]    Your satisfaction is our first priority. If you have any issues with the product, please feel free to contact us to get a replacement or a full refund. We will try our best to accommodate every inconvenience and problem that our customers encounter with great care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZXj38sUSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pavo","source_asin":"B0BPH97P16","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPH97P16","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPH97P16","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":432812,"name":"Wildflower Bouquet 2 Artwork by Sheila Golden, 14 by 19-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HQG8S0pqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features purple and yellow flowers. Sheila Golden grew up in New York, attending the School of Visual Arts and the New School of the Social Research in New York City, then worked in graphic design and illustration. She studied film animation, lithography and ceramics and received her bachelor's degree in fine art. While living in California, Sheila started teaching classes on watercolor collage. Sheila has combined her multiple skills and talents to translate her love of nature into painting and collage. Her original watercolors and watercolor collages are exhibited in numerous juried art shows around the country and her work is represented in private as well as corporate collections in major cities. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HQG8S0pqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00J97F3CK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J97F3CK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J97F3CK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
