window.products.push({"id":432834,"name":"DailyWise Extra Large Vacuum Storage Bags for Comforters, Space Bags for Pillows, Duvets, Blankets, Jumbo 8 Pack (35 x 47 inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vGHhMHOgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy to Use: 4 Simple Steps to Save Space and Keep Your Closet Organized! 1. Pack Ensure that everything you want to store is clean and completely dry. Open up the bag on a flat surface and undo the zip. Fold the materials and put them inside the bag carefully. Stack items on top of each other, but do not overfill. Make sure that there are a couple of centimeters spare from the edges of the clothes etc and the zip closure. 2. Zip With the items in place, use the plastic clip to zip along sealing the two plastic zips. Go back over the zips to ensure it is fully sealed. The surest way is to run the clip fully from end to end in both directions, and then to run your hand along the whole length of the zip between finger and thumb to ensure that there’s no tiny section missed. Please be noted that the clip is not fixed by design, so don’t panic when it falls off. 3. Vac When ready, undo the valve lid by unscrewing it, and then place the vacuum cleaner nozzle with no attachments on it over the valve. You simply need to press it against the valve, and then turn the vacuum on. It will then start to remove the air. You don’t need a perfect seal against the valve, but keep pressing it on firmly and the air will be extracted. Please be noted that 4. Store After vacuuming all the air out of the bag, stop and close the cap quickly to secure an air-tight seal. Listen carefully for any signs of air leaking out of the cap or other zipped parts of the bag. Repeat step 2 if necessary. If the bags are tightly sealed, congratulations, you can put them under your bed or wherever you think is suitable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vGHhMHOgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DailyWise","source_asin":"B07PPGR132","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PPGR132","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PPGR132","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":432835,"name":"FIFTY/FIFTY ( V18001BK0) Vacuum-Insulated Bottle, Black - 18 oz Capacity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71naVHcNSrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"18 ounce wide mouth vacuum insulated water bottles are the ideal size for the active person. Its 18 ounce capacity and compact size makes it very easy to throw it into your gym bag, backpack, and more for keeping hot or cold beverages with you all day. The double-wall vacuum insulated bottle is specifically designed to keep liquids hot or cold all day. Double-Wall technology also prevents condensation and keeps the outside wall of the bottle at a comfortable temperature, regardless of whether it is carrying a hot or cold beverage. These bottles are constructed from high quality, food grade 18/8 stainless steel, which unlike aluminum bottles, does not require any kind of liner. The stainless steel will not retain odor or taste, and are 100 percent recyclable. All components of the bottles, including the lid are 100 percent BPA free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71naVHcNSrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIFTY-FIFTY","source_asin":"B00YHG4C8O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YHG4C8O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YHG4C8O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
