window.products.push({"id":432846,"name":"Sandinrayli 10 PCs White Plastic Folding Chairs Commercial Quality Stackable Outdoor Event Wedding Party Chairs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":210.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jvPcxHB7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"√ PORTABLE AND CONVENIENT: It can be manually folded and locked in an upright position, folds flat and compact for easy storage. √ PERFECT FOR EVENTS: Set of 10 chair- ideal for businesses, offices, churches, schools, government, banquet halls, game halls, the white elegant design make them suitable for most situation,and makes it easy to throw parties and celebrate special occasions with friends and family. √ STABLE STRUCTURE: Lightweight but durable steel frame and plastic give the chairs built-to-last durability and comfort. √ FLOOR PROTECTION: If you use indoor, protective rubber feet help to keep the seat in place while minimizing scuffing, scratching, and other damage. √ OVERALL DIMENSIONS: 17.7” x 17.7” x 32”(LxWxH), and made of PP & Steel, weight capacity is up to 440 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jvPcxHB7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sandinrayli","source_asin":"B0923VQP96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0923VQP96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0923VQP96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":432847,"name":"Jute Bag with written “I'm Only Talking To My Dog Today” - Paw Print Canvas Tote Bag - Made with Premium Quality Material with Zipper Closure - Ideal ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818svBB3ODL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"These sturdy double handle tote bags are versatile and built to last. They feature reinforced double handles with a drop for easy carrying over the shoulder. The bags feature design of paw and a unique quote. Whether you fill them with gifts for a friend or groceries from the store, these bags are as fashionable as they are functional. These go-anywhere totes spotlight vacation destinations. Crafted from durable canvas with comfortable wrapped handles, they're perfect for shopping, travel and beach days spent in the sun. Add ultimate personalized touch that commemorates any occasion. Product Features: Inside of the bag is PP laminated that helps it from stains. This quality natural waterproof/ stain proof lined jute bag makes the perfect, practical birthday gift, that can be carried across the shoulder or by hand.  Our designs are created in house, and quite often originate from a hand drawing, by a traditional artist, something which is quite unheard of in the digital world we live in.  We are proud to offer our unique and exclusive designs on this quality, very popular tote bag.  It is slightly wider than a standard tote bag which makes it great for carrying shopping or larger items. Product Benefits: When you gift this birthday gift bag, the receiver will instantly know and appreciate your efforts to secure one of the best, yet extremely practical gift bags you will find anywhere.  A constant reminder that will help them think of you.  A practical gift that is strong enough to be used throughout the year.  Printed with a thoughtful and appropriate message that will demonstrate you truly care about your pet.  Bags are a fantastic way to show off one's taste and style and even display a hint of personality.  Our beach bag can be handled comfortably. Product Specifications: Length: 16 inches Height: 13 inches Width: 7 inches Package Included: 1 x Jute Bag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818svBB3ODL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BPY5XLMS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPY5XLMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPY5XLMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
