window.products.push({"id":432987,"name":"SoftBear Queen Size Blanket Flannel Fleece, Grey Blanket - Ultra Soft and Warm Blanket for Bedding, Couch, Sofa, Travel, Camping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fw2nboZtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Us SoftBear blankets will stand up to washing and drying for years without losing its color or shape sacrificing the softness and breathable fibers. Our blanket is so sublimely soft and plush; you’ll be hard-pressed to get out of bed. Every bed deserves one, and you’ll want the blanket version on every chair and sofa as well. Matches your personal taste It comes in twin, throw, and queen sizes and five colors — grey, burgundy, chocolate, black, and navy.  Flannel blanket’s luxurious 420 GSM microfleece providing a layer of decadent, weightless warmth. Available as a high-quality flannel fleece option or an even thicker and even more cozy premium plush version, our blankets are a perfect gift idea. The fabric is brushed on both sides, which means you can expect it. Delight your loved ones by giving them a shared memory that brings warmth to their living space in more ways than one to be ultra-soft and snuggable. Keep warm in your room. Blankets are great for practical use to do a nice job of keeping you warm when the air gets chilly. The build of throw blankets makes them great for draping over your shoulders as you read, watch a movie, or work in your home office. We are a good all year round, including in the summer months when the AC may be turned on extra high. Enhance the theme of your room Our blankets are the perfect accent to decorate your home while providing a fast way to get warm in the cold weather. Also great for living rooms, dens, family rooms, and finished basements.! If your home decor has a cottage, rustic, or farmhouse theme, an embossed patterned blanket can be the perfect finishing touch. SoftBear is sure to carry a decorative blanket that matches your personal taste! Return Policy You may return any of the following items, for any reason, for a full refund within 30 days of delivery of your shipment.  If you have any concerns, please do not hesitate to ask.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fw2nboZtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOFTBEAR","source_asin":"B0876H2KTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-432987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0876H2KTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0876H2KTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
